say for instance of invoices, and you need to know&nbsp;
the total expenditures doing this running total&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:24:05.359 --> 02:24:10.799
is actually how you would do it and relative&nbsp;
references will be useful for that one. On the&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:24:10.800 --> 02:24:15.680
other hand, sometimes you say don't just go one&nbsp;
to the left or one above. But you need to tell it&nbsp;&nbsp;

