to refer to a specific column or a specific row&nbsp;
even when you're moving things around. That's&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:24:22.240 --> 02:24:27.040
where you get the idea of an absolute reference.&nbsp;
Now, I'm going to multiply numbers in this little&nbsp;&nbsp;

