to say so formula will take one to the left. And&nbsp;
I'll type an asterisk to multiply and I'll do it&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:24:38.080 --> 02:24:45.040
one to the top. Okay, one times two is easy.&nbsp;
But watch what happens if I drag that down.&nbsp;&nbsp;

