It's not going to do five times two here is&nbsp;
doing five times six. And if I drag that all&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:24:50.160 --> 02:24:55.519
to the right, then I end up with some really&nbsp;
big numbers instead of this should be 30 down&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:24:55.520 --> 02:25:01.440
here instead of 3 million. And so that's not&nbsp;
what we Want to do, I'm going to back that up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:25:02.479 --> 02:25:08.559
Instead, I need to tell it that when it goes&nbsp;
to the left, it needs to always go to column E.&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:25:09.200 --> 02:25:14.960
And when it goes to the top, it needs to always&nbsp;
go to row two. But even though it always goes&nbsp;&nbsp;

