is to use $1 sign on the US keyboard that's&nbsp;
above the four. And that says, always go to E,&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:25:39.920 --> 02:25:46.399
although it can adjust the row. And over&nbsp;
here, it says you can adjust the column but&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:25:46.399 --> 02:25:53.599
always go to row number two. And when I do&nbsp;
that, watch what happens, I can drag that.&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:25:55.840 --> 02:26:01.520
And now it works the way I want to. So if I click&nbsp;
on this one, you can see it's multiplying that&nbsp;&nbsp;

